        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1d5d7fe5-cc7b-4e3c-b94a-f26468face37\",\"review_text\":\"Pleaseeee can i get it i just want ittttttt😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭\"},{\"review_id\":\"f76ca84c-9c2f-4501-989d-38839036e92a\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing i can watch some of my favorite shows\"},{\"review_id\":\"a45f4070-9572-4e58-a341-14a0f96b6055\",\"review_text\":\"Best for music recommendation\"},{\"review_id\":\"546a5baa-a78f-4209-b598-2956aceb7d58\",\"review_text\":\"like the music\"},{\"review_id\":\"4a0de7f2-c63c-4b63-8c96-122ed8367000\",\"review_text\":\"The new update is the worst. Listening to music should be relaxing and of our choices. Now we can't do that. What is this? Disgusting\"},{\"review_id\":\"61549d83-ab16-40bc-ac7b-daad16702fef\",\"review_text\":\"Could use some UI work to reach feature parity with iOS\"},{\"review_id\":\"283da61a-5794-4d32-b9a2-906f407068af\",\"review_text\":\"It added song I don't want and keeps on adding I'm just trying to listen to my music .\"},{\"review_id\":\"e518ac2e-dd3f-4c5c-b52e-e2a83bfdcc12\",\"review_text\":\"I can't access a lot of my songs. They're just greyed out and unavailable. If I pay for premium, why can't I get access to my songs? Utterly disappointed with Spotify.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a8dd67dd-6064-486c-b3bb-4b87d5a9e088\",\"review_text\":\"It's a great app actually just need more updates amd all\"},{\"review_id\":\"9fe67399-4066-4acb-9cba-61ac1a30b899\",\"review_text\":\"Nais\"}]}"
